nged, 149 insertions(+), 134 deletions(-)\ncommit 7d9346de73eb0866f67ac449ee09507d62ddf954\nAuthor: Sonny To <son.c.to@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sun Nov 15 23:22:43 2026 -0500\n\n    fix(udp): retain receive diagnostics and close seam once on fatal descriptor errors (P2)\n\n src/jolt/dao/stream/udp.jolt | 124 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------\n 1 file changed, 80 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)\ncommit a7357c8874d04dee40f3cf9ba08915fb354b7a63\nAuthor: Sonny To <son.c.to@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sun Nov 15 23:23:12 2026 -0500\n\n    test(jolt): reconcile J7 applicability and add failure-injection probe (P1)\n\n bb.edn                                         |   5 +\n src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj                       |  36 ++-\n src/dev/jolt_udp_failures_probe.clj            | 375 +++++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/dev/jolt_udp_failures_probe.sh             |  24 ++\n test/resources/yin/repl/jolt-applicability.edn |  22 +-\n 5 files changed, 437 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)\n# written by bb bootstrap:jolt from jolt-toolchain.edn; do not edit\nexport JOLT_CHEZ='/home/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/chezscheme/10.4.1/bin/scheme'\nexport JOLT_HOME='/home/sto/ci/dw-j7/build/tools/jolt'\nexport JOLT_PATCHES='/home/sto/ci/dw-j7/build/tools/jolt-patches.edn'\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
