{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The binder now checks close-on-exec and IPv6-only setup, protects more allocations with cleanup, and records receive errors. I’m checking two remaining edge cases: a failure inside a helper that allocates multiple buffers, and a packet-delivery error being treated as a fatal socket error.\n"}}
